WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,740 --> 00:00:03,540
I didn’t expect this person to have a quilt here.

2
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:05,020
Brother, I will bring you two people

3
00:00:05,020 --> 00:00:05,980
What a great job

4
00:00:05,980 --> 00:00:06,980
Aren’t you going to unload the goods now?

5
00:00:06,980 --> 00:00:07,900
Let them help unload it

6
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:08,860
Such a good figure

7
00:00:08,860 --> 00:00:09,900
It's for decoration.

8
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:11,220
Right? It's awesome.

9
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:12,860
I just watched them helping Boss Lin unload the goods

10
00:00:12,860 --> 00:00:13,980
Someone else might have to unload a day's worth of cargo

11
00:00:13,980 --> 00:00:15,580
It took them half a day to unload that line

12
00:00:15,580 --> 00:00:16,580
My car is coming soon

13
00:00:16,580 --> 00:00:17,740
Can you guys help unload the goods?

14
00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:20,700
After unloading the goods, I will pay you three hundred yuan. Thank you, boss.

15
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:25,860
Then you guys are here to help my brother with his work. The car is here.

16
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:26,900
Ready to unload

17
00:00:29,520 --> 00:00:31,040
The speed is okay, come on

18
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:32,440
Come in first, drink some water and take a rest.

19
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:38,400
These are quilts from previous years

20
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:39,520
Never sold

21
00:00:39,520 --> 00:00:40,840
We are ready to deal with it at a low price

22
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:41,960
low price treatment

23
00:00:41,960 --> 00:00:44,160
How is this a low-priced thing like this?

24
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:46,960
We always dispose of this quilt at the lowest price

25
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:49,200
Originally, it was considered wholesale if you bought it for around 100 for 50%.

26
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:51,360
At the very least, you get about eighty yuan for a bed.

27
00:00:51,360 --> 00:00:52,760
But now we deal with it at a low price

28
00:00:52,760 --> 00:00:54,320
Fifty yuan a bed boss

29
00:00:54,320 --> 00:00:56,240
How many beds do you have here? Can I buy them?
